## 前端開發模式

### 狀態管理
```javascript
// 使用全域變數管理核心狀態
let allEvents = [];
let currentView = '今日';
let currentUser = null;

// localStorage 持久化
localStorage.setItem('selectedInstructor', name);
```

### DOM 操作
```javascript
// ✅ 批量渲染 (性能優化)
const html = events.map(event => `
    <div class="event-card">${event.title}</div>
`).join('');
container.innerHTML = html;
```

### API 呼叫
```javascript
// ✅ async/await
async function loadEvents() {
    try {
        const response = await fetch('/api/events');
        const data = await response.json();
        if (data.success) {
            allEvents = data.data;
            renderEvents();
        }
    } catch (error) {
        console.error('❌ 載入失敗:', error);
    }
}
```

