## 資料格式規範

### 事件物件
```javascript
{
    id: "event-uuid",
    title: "課程名稱 - 講師名稱",
    start: "2025-10-29T10:00:00+08:00",
    end: "2025-10-29T12:00:00+08:00",
    location: "教室地點",
    description: "課程描述",
    color: "#FF6B6B",
    teacher: "講師名稱",
    courseType: "課程類型"
}
```

### 簽到記錄
```javascript
{
    eventId: "event-uuid",
    studentId: "student-id",
    studentName: "學生姓名",
    timestamp: "2025-10-29T10:05:00+08:00",
    status: "present", // present, late, absent, leave
    note: "備註"
}
```

### 學生物件
```javascript
{
    id: "student-id",
    name: "學生姓名",
    lineUserId: "LINE-USER-ID",
    courses: ["課程1", "課程2"],
    active: true
}
```

### 講師物件
```javascript
{
    name: "講師姓名",
    color: "#FF6B6B",
    userId: "LINE-USER-ID",
    courses: ["課程類型1", "課程類型2"]
}
```

